{
  "id": 91933528,
  "iid": 2369,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "tshark, export_pdu: Allow tshark to export PDUs to other file types",
  "description": "The export PDU API now allows writing to a different file type. tshark\nalready has a -F flag for the output file type. If that option is given,\nrespect it for export PDU. Also, rec.rec_header.packet_header.pkt_encap\nexpects WTAP encapsulation types, not PCAP encapsulation types, so don't\ncall wtap_wtap_encap_to_pcap_encap(), or else it won't actually write to\npcap files, only pcapng (using the wrong sort of encap numbers eventually\nleads to WTAP_ENCAP_PER_PACKET, which we don't write to non-pcapng.)",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2021-03-13T03:24:38.667Z",
  "updated_at": "2021-03-14T00:59:51.462Z",
