        "9bd144b8ea30a7345eca3c0cb590bc146f45f97c"
      ],
      "title": "tshark, export_pdu: Allow tshark to export PDUs to other file types",
      "message": "tshark, export_pdu: Allow tshark to export PDUs to other file types\n\nThe export PDU API now allows writing to a different file type. tshark\nalready has a -F flag for the output file type. If that option is given,\nrespect it for export PDU. Also, rec.rec_header.packet_header.pkt_encap\nexpects WTAP encapsulation types, not PCAP encapsulation types, so don't\ncall wtap_wtap_encap_to_pcap_encap(), or else it won't actually write to\npcap files, only pcapng (using the wrong sort of encap numbers eventually\nleads to WTAP_ENCAP_PER_PACKET, which we don't write to non-pcapng.)\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-03-12T22:12:40.000-05:00",
      "committer_name": "Guy Harris",
      "committer_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
      "committed_date": "2021-03-14T00:14:40.000+00:00",
